      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/East_Carbon%2C_Utah",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Coal mining shaped the town, and its historic coke ovens and railroad yard still echo that industrial past.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
