        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.carbon.utah.gov/explore-the-corridor/stay/communities/east-carbon/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "East Carbon’s high‑desert landscape is framed by dramatic cliffs and open vistas, creating a striking natural backdrop.",
